  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Programme funds to support the Open Government Partnership is a component of Support to the Open Government Partnership reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xA3;1,470,000. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Media and free flow of information, Democratic participation and civil society, Public sector policy and administrative management, Anti-corruption organisations and institutions.</narrative>
